...@lib/theme
# W04: one legal race outcome, with abort winning the authoritative CAS.
shape: sequence_diagram
coord: Original coordinator
issuer: Original issuer
ledger: Authoritative ledger
broker: Broker gate
coord -> ledger: Persist ConsumePending: exact command / attempt
coord -> issuer: Consume original signed grant
issuer -> issuer: Remove pending grant
coord -> coord: Response timeout\nconsumption is unknown
coord -> ledger: AbortNoDispatch CAS\nclaim must be absent
ledger -> coord: Durable abort wins
issuer -> coord: Late positive response
coord -> ledger: Late commit proposal with original correlation
ledger -> coord: Reject: attempt is terminal
coord -> broker: Status observation only\nno emission handle
broker -> broker: No SendCommitted / claim\nno send
ledger.rule: "if abort reply is lost, resolve the durable command first.\nIf a claim won another race, abort/refund must fail."

# Shared role accents; brand marks are confined to architecture headers.
coord.class: runtime
issuer.class: policy
ledger.class: ledger
broker.class: runtime
ledger.rule.class: note
